  "notes": "USAGE:\n{補助|ほじょ} is extremely common in compound words and as a modifier meaning \"auxiliary\" or \"supplementary.\" It can also function as a する verb meaning \"to assist\" or \"to subsidize.\"\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {補助|ほじょ}{金|きん} (subsidy, grant)\n- {補助|ほじょ}{輪|りん} (training wheels)\n- {補助|ほじょ}{席|せき} (extra seat, folding seat)\n- {補助|ほじょ}{的|てき} (supplementary, auxiliary)\n- {補助|ほじょ}を{受|う}ける (receive assistance/a subsidy)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {援助|えんじょ}: aid, assistance (larger-scale, often international)\n- {助成|じょせい}: financial support, grant aid (mainly monetary, institutional)\n- {支援|しえん}: support (broader, includes non-financial help)",
